Package: singlify
Type: Package
Title: Read Singlify Pipeline Outputs into R
Version: 0.2.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Zach", "DeBruine", email = "debruinz@gvsu.edu",
           role = c("aut", "cre")))
Description: Reads singlify pipeline output files (.1pz sparse matrices
    and their embedded GEO metadata) into native R sparse-matrix classes
    and single-cell analysis objects. Provides converters to
    SingleCellExperiment and Seurat so the outputs of the singlify
    single-cell reprocessing pipeline can drop directly into existing
    Bioconductor and Seurat workflows. All format parsing and
    decompression happens in a shared header-only C++ reader that is
    bit-identical to the Python wrapper.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
LazyData: false
