    Rcpp (>= 1.0.10),
    Matrix (>= 1.5)
LinkingTo:
    Rcpp
Suggests:
    SingleCellExperiment,
    SummarizedExperiment,
    Seurat,
    testthat (>= 3.0.0),
    knitr,
    rmarkdown
VignetteBuilder: knitr
SystemRequirements: C++17, libzstd (>= 1.4)
